"""EW-0A certification runner (trusted-side).

Executes the seven EW-0A certification missions against the REAL machinery:
  * the Engineer candidate is generated by the REAL local model (qwen2.5:7b) via
    the inference-only facade in the Agent-Lab sandbox (WSL interop);
  * each attempt runs in a REAL disposable git worktree (canonical tree untouched);
  * deterministic checks use REAL pytest / py_compile;
  * verification is performed by the REAL, INDEPENDENT GPT supervisor.

Neither the Engineer nor Claude may self-certify. A mission's GATE is that the
CONTROL behaves correctly (failed work is not certified, protected ops are denied,
interruption is not success), not that the task necessarily succeeds.

Run:  .venv/bin/python tools/ew0a_certify.py
Env:  EW0A_GPT_KEY_FILE (default /home/pesan/.ew0a_openai_key)  — trusted-side only.
"""
